PiAgentCore is a Swift port of the agent-loop contract of pi
(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi, packages/agent and packages/ai),
copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner, MIT License.

The port covers types, the agent loop, the Agent state machine, streaming
event assembly, tool-argument validation and streaming-JSON repair. It does
not include pi's provider adapters, Node execution environment, extension
system or lane-based session runtime.

Currently aligned with pi 0.85.1. See UPSTREAM.md.
